+            // the block so no intermediate crosses the block boundary;
+            // only sampl/sampr/rc0raw/rc1raw leave via UMOV (the
+            // unavoidable scalar interface to the sum chain, which stays
+            // serial and in order). multi() = sx20(a)*b with int32 wrap
+            // maps to SHL/SSHR #12 + MUL low 32 bits; sx20(x>>k) maps
+            // to SBFX (exact bit-field sign extend). Serial accumulation
+            // into ram1[31]/rcsum untouched.
